+
+## Gate results
+
+### Gate A — PASS
+
+- A1: `SPEC.is-prime` binds `is_prime` to the exact translated closure body;
+  the body executes under fixed semantics. Regenerating with
+  `python3 py2mpy.py solution.py` exactly matches `solution.mpy`. The material
